# Characters

## Cast and lore

Canonical pages: **`wiki/Characters.md`** (index) and **`wiki/characters/<Name>/<Name>.md`** (one folder per character). Read those before writing dialogue, descriptions, or outfit/level details for a named character. Do not use stale names from memory (e.g. the headmaster is **Mark Benson**, page `Headmaster`).

Character card PNGs are HS2 / StudioNeoV2 cards: extra binary is keyed to the filename. Never rename, recompress, or re-export them. See `wiki/README.md`.

## Implementation

There is no separate Character *system* wiki page. For APIs, read:

- `game/scripts/character.rpy` — `Person` / `Char`, `get_person`, `get_person_char`, `find_person`, paperdoll helpers
- `game/scripts/values.rpy` — character definitions and styling
- Dialogue and `show` usage in events: `wiki/Events.md` (characters & dialogue)
- Layered sprites: `wiki/Paperdoll.md`

Storage groups: `"class_3a"` (students), `"staff"`, `"parents"`.
